From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 12:22:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 17/22] libcameraservice: restore HAL1 device support in
 CameraProviderManager

Accept HIDL device@1.x in ProviderInfo::addDevice and add HidlDeviceInfo1
(restored from the Android 11 DeviceInfo1) which probes flash/torch support and
legacy CameraInfo by briefly opening the device. Add
HidlProviderInfo::startDeviceInterface1(), CameraProviderManager::openHidlSession1()
and a findDeviceInfoLocked() overload taking a version range; the single-id
lookup falls back to HAL1 devices so getCameraInfo(), hasFlashUnit(),
setTorchMode() etc. work for them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I2e67ba92d8d8c0349c3648c960aa895bf1aec747
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
